  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: Transitive (⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧).\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{姿勢|しせい}→姿勢：00371_shisei⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{正|ただ}す (to straighten one's posture)\n- ⟦{襟|えり}→襟：06487_eri⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{正|ただ}す (to straighten one's collar - idiom meaning to compose oneself formally)\n- ⟦{間違|まちが}い→間違い：03733_machigai⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{正|ただ}す (to correct a mistake)\n- ⟦{真偽|しんぎ}→真偽：05564_shingi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{正|ただ}す (to inquire about the truth)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {直|なお}す (to fix/repair - more general)\n- ⟦{訂正|ていせい}する→訂正する：10443_teiseisuru⟧ (to correct - for written errors)",
